    "requests": {
      "opening_time": {
        "inputs": [
          {
            "text": "So, Saturday. I think we have to give up on the courtyard. The forecast's got worse. We can have the small hall, but the craft group are in there until half past ten, and that's when they finish, not when the room's clear.",
            "voice_id": "Xb7hH8MSUJpSbSDYk0k2"
          },
          {
            "text": "Then eleven's the earliest. We need to get the tables in, run the cables... I'd rather not have people waiting around us while we do that.",
            "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb"
          },
          {
            "text": "Hang on, let me check who's booked before eleven. Three. Two bikes and a toaster. Are we taking bikes inside?",
            "voice_id": "pFZP5JQG7iQjIQuC4Bku"
          },
          {
            "text": "Could they go under the awning?",
            "voice_id": "Xb7hH8MSUJpSbSDYk0k2"
          },
          {
            "text": "With the repair stands there, we'd be blocking the doorway. And rain comes in sideways under that thing. I think we have to cancel the bikes this time.",
            "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb"
          }
        ],
        "model_id": "eleven_v3",
        "language_code": "en",
        "seed": 60709,
        "settings": {
          "stability": 0.5
        },
        "apply_text_normalization": "off"
      },
      "bookings_and_space": {
        "inputs": [
          {
            "text": "Okay. I'll ring those two, then. I don't want them cycling over in the rain for nothing. Next month's session, or do we know somewhere sooner?",
            "voice_id": "pFZP5JQG7iQjIQuC4Bku"
          },
          {
            "text": "There's the bike workshop at the library next weekend. I'll check they've got spaces before we send anyone there.",
            "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb"
          },
          {
            "text": "Thanks. And I've got eleven fifteen free for the toaster, if that suits them. Everything after eleven can stay as it is.",
            "voice_id": "pFZP5JQG7iQjIQuC4Bku"
          },
          {
            "text": "How many tables can we actually fit?",
            "voice_id": "Xb7hH8MSUJpSbSDYk0k2"
          },
          {
            "text": "Four comfortably. Two for electrical repairs, one for sewing, one for intake. No spare table for people to leave things on.",
            "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb"
          },
          {
            "text": "That's fine. I'll keep the waiting list at the desk. People need to stay with their stuff anyway.",
            "voice_id": "pFZP5JQG7iQjIQuC4Bku"
          }
        ],
        "model_id": "eleven_v3",
        "language_code": "en",
        "seed": 60710,
        "settings": {
          "stability": 0.5
        },
        "apply_text_normalization": "off"
      },
      "owners_and_cutoff": {
        "inputs": [
          {
            "text": "I'll update the website and the neighbourhood group tonight. And put a sign on the courtyard gate. Actually, I'll be there from ten until we open, because someone will have seen the old time.",
            "voice_id": "Xb7hH8MSUJpSbSDYk0k2"
          },
          {
            "text": "I'll tell the repair volunteers half ten for setup. Still finishing at one?",
            "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb"
          },
          {
            "text": "Yes, we can't keep everyone late.",
            "voice_id": "Xb7hH8MSUJpSbSDYk0k2"
          },
          {
            "text": "Last walk-ins at quarter past twelve, then? We can have a look, but I won't promise we'll fix it.",
            "voice_id": "pFZP5JQG7iQjIQuC4Bku"
          },
          {
            "text": "Exactly. And we stop taking things earlier if the queue's full.",
            "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb"
          },
          {
            "text": "Good. I'll make those three calls now.",
            "voice_id": "pFZP5JQG7iQjIQuC4Bku"
          }
        ],
        "model_id": "eleven_v3",
        "language_code": "en",
        "seed": 60711,
